- **Return shape unchanged** (\`Method\` / \`BookingCount\` / \`RevenueVnd\` / \`Share\`) so callers/UI are compatible; \`BookingCount\` is now the number of payment lines for that method (previously booking count). Totals are unaffected — only per-method attribution shifts. Historical single-payment invoices remain correct (a 1-element group).

